# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT in this repository
#
# 02AI_drawing_data/         the source corpus. It holds festival visitors' own words,
#                            including 8 records with real names that are redacted at
#                            LOAD time rather than on disk (see emoviz/preprocess_names.py).
#                            Keep it local and back it up somewhere you control.
# project_notes/literature/  97 copyrighted PDFs. references.bib and the notes are tracked.
# emoviz/.venv/              1 GB, fully regenerable with `bash emoviz/setup.sh`.
# emoviz/private/            the reviewed name-redaction decision table. It names the tokens it
#                            redacts, so it travels with the dataset, never with the repository.
# *.prename / *.nodedup      pre-redaction backups; they contain the unredacted names.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
02AI_drawing_data/
project_notes/literature/*
!project_notes/literature/references.bib
!project_notes/literature/*.md

emoviz/.venv/
emoviz/private/
**/*.prename
**/*.nodedup

# presentation build tooling and renders
project_notes/presentation/deck_source/node_modules/
project_notes/presentation/deck_source/package-lock.json
project_notes/presentation/deck_source/*slide-*.jpg

# build and scratch artefacts
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.blg
*.bbl
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
emoviz/outputs/app.log
emoviz/outputs/human_check/sheet_*.png
.DS_Store
**/~$*

# the student's signature image: keep it out of the repository
dissertation/images/signature.png

# local only, never committed: the files as submitted (the PDF is signed), the Link C text,
# university correspondence, the Overleaf exports (they hold the signature) and a chat export
/PremAnandh_ShreHari_COM6912_*
/LinkC_title_and_abstract.txt
/University of Sheffield Mail*
/dissertation copy/
/dissertation copy.zip
/dissertation_overleaf*.zip
emoviz/2026-09-12-190329-local-command-caveatcaveat-the-messages-below.txt
emoviz/outputs/human_check/labels.csv.bak
